-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §23 היקף העסקה: a principal of a school
-- that applies the reform is employed at a position of 100%, and not
-- beyond it — a principal employed beyond 100% on the eve of the signing
-- too.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `23 היקף העסקה`

-- ¶1: a principal serving in a school "בו מיושמת הרפורמה" is employed at a
-- position of 100% (1 is a full position), "ולא מעבר לכך". The school
-- applies the reform in full or in part: where the agreement means in full
-- only it says "באופן מלא" (§§24(ד), 25(ג)). Of a principal in a school
-- that does not apply it the section says nothing (NOTHING). "למען הסר
-- ספק", the position he held on the eve of the signing (13.8.2011) does
-- not matter: one employed beyond 100% then is employed at 100% now.
@ref akn:art_23
GIVEN e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
      `his position on the eve of the signing` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the position section 23 employs a principal at` e `his position on the eve of the signing` IS
    IF e EQUALS `off the Oz reform`
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE JUST 1

GIVEN e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 23 bars a principal from more than a full position in` e IF
    NOT e EQUALS `off the Oz reform`

§§ `23 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `the position section 23 employs a principal at` `the Oz reform in part` 1 EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `the position section 23 employs a principal at` `the Oz reform in full` 1.2 EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `the position section 23 employs a principal at` `off the Oz reform` 1.2 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `section 23 bars a principal from more than a full position in` `the Oz reform in part`
